family Cooker Hood
category mechanical
host floor
ifc IfcElectricAppliance NOTDEFINED
param Power number type 250
param Width length type 600mm
param Depth length type 500mm
param Elevation length type 1550mm
param Canopy length type 120mm
param Chimney length type 250mm
param ChimneyH length type 500mm
param Duct length type 150mm
param Casing material type "Stainless Steel"
ref Left x = -Width / 2
ref Right x = Width / 2
ref Front y = -Depth / 2
ref Back y = Depth / 2
type "600" Width=600mm
type "900" Width=900mm
type "24in" Width=24in, Depth=20in, Elevation=61in, Duct=6in
extrude Canopy rect(Left, Front, Right, Back) z(Elevation, Elevation + Canopy) mat(Casing) show(3d, elev)
extrude Chimney rect(-Chimney / 2, Back - Chimney, Chimney / 2, Back) z(Elevation + Canopy, Elevation + Canopy + ChimneyH) mat(Casing) show(3d, elev)
symbol rect(Left, Front, Right, Back) show(medium, fine)
symbol rect(-Chimney / 2, Back - Chimney, Chimney / 2, Back)
connector Exhaust duct exhaust_air at(0, Back - Chimney / 2, Elevation + Canopy + ChimneyH) dir(0, 0, 1) size(Duct)
connector Power conduit power at(0, Back, Elevation + Canopy + ChimneyH - 100mm) dir(0, 1, 0) size(20mm)
